{"Using `forEach(async ...)` in bookings router means the caller never waits for the deletions to complete - promises are never awaited, deletions run in background and errors can be lost": 0.931388795375824, "Fetching video adapters is now fully sequential with for...of loop awaiting each dynamic import - these independent imports could be parallelized with Promise.all for better performance": 0.4768284857273102, "`getCalendar` is now async but some code (e.g. `getCalendarCredentials` in `CalendarManager`) still calls it without `await`, so those call sites will receive a `Promise` instead of a `Calendar | null`": 0.9252919554710388, "`appStore` now stores `Promise` values from dynamic imports but typing doesn't reflect `Record<string, Promise<Module>>`, which could allow accidental non-awaited access": 0.7931419610977173}